{
  "description": "OpenAPPA consult protocol v1, kind=context: the requests an APPA runtime sends to an [externals.context.stenographer] url binding. Wire shape from openappa appa-runtime/src/consult.rs (Consult serializes {version, kind, name, declaration, artifact}; ContextArtifact is {tool, arguments, cwd?}; ContextDeclaration is {}) and appa-runtime/src/external.rs (reqwest POST with .json(), bearer_auth from token_env). The bearer value is replaced with the test server's token.",
  "requests": [
    {
      "name": "bash-asserts-dead-literal",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/appa/context",
      "headers": {
        "content-type": "application/json",
        "accept": "*/*",
        "authorization": "Bearer <token>"
      },
      "body": {
        "version": 1,
        "kind": "context",
        "name": "stenographer",
        "declaration": {},
        "artifact": {
          "tool": "Bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "printf 'LOG_BUDGET=30\\n' >> .env && node scripts/limiter.js --impl legacyRateLimiter",
            "description": "Restore the old log budget"
          },
          "cwd": "/work/checkout"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "edit-removes-dead-literal",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/appa/context",
      "headers": {
        "content-type": "application/json",
        "accept": "*/*",
        "authorization": "Bearer <token>"
      },
      "body": {
        "version": 1,
        "kind": "context",
        "name": "stenographer",
        "declaration": {},
        "artifact": {
          "tool": "Edit",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "/work/checkout/src/config.ts",
            "old_string": "export const LOG_BUDGET = 30;",
            "new_string": "export const LOG_BUDGET = 100;"
          },
          "cwd": "/work/checkout"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unrelated-fetch",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/appa/context",
      "headers": {
        "content-type": "application/json",
        "accept": "*/*",
        "authorization": "Bearer <token>"
      },
      "body": {
        "version": 1,
        "kind": "context",
        "name": "stenographer",
        "declaration": {},
        "artifact": {
          "tool": "fetch",
          "arguments": { "url": "https://a.example" }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
